codemap 8
path cli-exec
kind layer
author ai
group cli
note exec.rs: where a Request does its work. Run holds what one command may touch (the Index, the Map, the author to record, the language servers when the CLI has them, the Output to write) and has one method per command; each finds what the user named, calls Index and Map methods, and hands values to wire.rs to print. Nothing here formats text or touches a file except through a store it is given (MapStore for diff's parent map, Vcs for repin's old text), and every refusal is a Failure value. The feature-<name> paths follow each command's method; this path holds what the methods share: the lookups that turn typed names into ids, and the one way a command asks the servers for files.

